        "id": "intro-comment",
        "type": "nodetool.workflows.base_node.Comment",
        "data": {
          "comment": "# Single Shot from a Line\n\nRenders one video shot from a line of direction. It also works as a quick check that your video provider credentials work before you run a template that bills several generations.\n\n**How it works:** \"Shot\" holds the line, a rainy diner window by default. \"Prompt\" is a template that appends the house look: slow camera move, shallow depth of field, no text. \"Render\" makes a 6-second 16:9 clip at 1080p with a negative prompt against watermarks, and \"Clip\" returns it.\n\n**Try this:** Pick a model on \"Render\", then edit the camera wording in \"Prompt\" to change the look of every shot."
        },
